[1.793408, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.793815, "o", "\u001b[1;36m==> 7/7  payment-data-pvc Pending -> recreate the deleted StorageClass\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.866477, "o", "storageclass.storage.k8s.io/standard created\r\n"]
[1.869097, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mAll 7 remediations applied. Re-run k8sgpt to see the finding count drop.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
